/.claude/settings.local.json
# Claude Code user config bind-mounted by .devcontainer (holds credentials) -- never commit
/.private_claude/
__pycache__/
# Must be `/outputs/*`, not `/outputs/` — git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent *directory* is excluded, so the negation below is silently dead against
# a directory pattern. dvc.yaml declares metrics.json `cache: false`, i.e.
# "versioned in git, not the DVC cache", which the blanket ignore was quietly
# making a lie: it was tracked by neither. Per-experiment copies of this and the
# rest of each run also live in experiments/.
/outputs/*
!/outputs/metrics.json
!/outputs/summary.json
# ML-2 seg_eval@<model> metrics (dvc.yaml: cache: false), versioned in git for the same reason.
!/outputs/seg_eval_*.json
/tensorboard/
/dvc_plots/
*.pt
*.kate-swp
/.ood_eval_cache/
# heavy OOD sidecars belong in DVC alongside the .pt, not in git history
*.ood_embeddings.npz
# Pretrained upstream backbones: the weights are large and, for DINOv3, not ours to
# redistribute -- but models_pretrained/README.md and manifest.json MUST stay tracked.
# They are the acquisition instructions and the checksums, i.e. the only way a fresh
# clone can obtain and verify the right files. Ignoring the whole directory (as this
# line did until 2026-09-21) hid exactly the two files that make it reproducible.
/models_pretrained/**/*.pth
/models_pretrained/**/*.pt
/models_pretrained/**/*.safetensors
/webapp/BUILD_INFO.json
